<title>USA: FDP Corp raises qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>FDP Corp raises qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.0125		     $0.04</p>
